    // Family guide: How to Pay for a Care Home in California (src/guides/paying-for-a-care-home.html)
    "How to Pay for a Care Home in California | Love RCFE": "कैलिफ़ोर्निया में देखभाल गृह का खर्च कैसे चुकाएँ | Love RCFE",
